§ `reg 55.01 -- self-employed persons`

-- (1): the same four reasons, for a self-employed person; the job interview and the job search are not in 55.01.
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: undergoing medical treatment outside Canada` 30 `test stranger` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: attending a funeral` 7 `test parent` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: attending a funeral` 8 `test parent` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: accompanying a member of the immediate family for medical treatment outside Canada` 7 `test spouse` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: visiting a member of the immediate family who is seriously ill or injured` 7 `test child` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: attending a bona fide job interview` 7 `test stranger` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` TRUE `er3 purpose: conducting a bona fide job search` 14 `test stranger` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1) the self-employed person is not disentitled for the reason that they are outside Canada` FALSE `er3 purpose: attending a funeral` 7 `test parent` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1.1) the most consecutive days of a single trip that cumulates the periods of paragraphs (1)(b) and (d)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST 14
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(1.1) the most consecutive days of a single trip that cumulates the periods of paragraphs (1)(b) and (d)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(2) a member of the self-employed person's immediate family` `test spouse` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 55.01(2) a member of the self-employed person's immediate family` `test grandparent` EQUALS FALSE
